  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">减少制作锭所需的金和下界合金碎片的用量，在切石机中使用远古残骸时可获得更多产出。</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">现已包含适用于 1.20+ 的升级模板合成配方</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/985213811055263834/1089715217983868968/crafting.png\" alt=\"更便宜的下界合金锭合成\" width=\"577\" height=\"236\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/985213811055263834/1089715218214551552/stonecutting.png\" alt=\"更便宜的下界合金碎片合成\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/985213811055263834/1125364715242143844/2023-07-03_04.48.00.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
